00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.740
This is the world of Beyonders.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:29.160
By drinking potions, humans are able to attain 
various Beyonder powers,

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:32.460
and ascend to divinity.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:38.760
The 22 Pathways begin 
with the weakest, Sequence 9.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.280
The lower the Sequence,

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.060
the stronger a Beyonder's abilities.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:50.580
Strong Beyonders of the higher-level Sequences
can wield powers strong enough to rival gods.

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:54.260
This path of evolution is called:

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.260
the Path of the Divine.

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.230
Amid the crimson light,

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:13.750
Klein saw Dunn Smith crouching 
over Kenley White’s corpse.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:26.630
Captain.

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:29.550
The Captain was drinking Kenley's blood!

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:33.030
What’s going on?

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:35.420
He's showing early signs 
of losing control?

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:36.700
It can't be.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.950
The Captain has been acting 
as a Nightmare all along.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:39.910
Klein?

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:54.590
What's wrong?

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:58.950
No… it’s nothing.
I’m just a little tired.

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:03.190
Don’t let grief cloud your mind.

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.750
You must get used to this quickly.

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:10.870
Examine Sharon Koy’s Spirit Body with 
Spirit Channeling before it disappears.

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:17.670
Understood, Captain.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.760
The Captain seems fine.
Nothing's unusual.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:28.150
Did I imagine things?

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.350
No.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:32.910
I didn't hallucinate.

00:02:33.350 --> 00:02:34.830
Kenley's body...

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:37.150
really is missing something!

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:40.440
Episode 12    The Bomb

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:40.440
Tomorrow or the Unexpected, 
One Always Comes First

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:00.850
Why? Why must it always end like this...

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:02.430
Kenley...

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:04.610
He just got engaged last month.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.270
Why did he have 
to become a Beyonder?

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:11.790
Why must there always be danger?

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:14.190
May the Goddess bless you,

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:16.430
and grant you true rest.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.570
Captain...

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.500
What exactly did he do?

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.390
He told me to go downstairs and handle
the aftermath. Just to distract me?

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:33.830
Kenley...

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:40.630
He fell victim to 3-0217’s backlash—
something <i>the Captain</i> had given him.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:42.790
What am I thinking...

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.390
It was the necessary 
decision back then.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:47.430
Yet...

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:49.860
3-0217...

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.190
had been recommended 
by the Captain himself.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:57.110
Klein’s Spirit Channeling 
of Sharon Koy revealed:

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:59.950
The Demoness Sect might be 
working with the Aurora Order,

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.950
and is tied to the Lanevus case 
and Tingen’s Doomsday.

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:05.750
Follow this lead and 
investigate it carefully.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.020
Understood.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:12.590
Captain, now that Sharon Koy is dead, 
can Tingen’s Doomsday be averted?

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:17.430
Sharon Koy had a decisive role in Doomsday.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.430
But evil organizations never 
limit themselves to a single plan.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:30.510
Two months ago

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:42.750
Howes Street

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.320
62 Howes Street

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.360
The Count Returns

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.360
Don’t miss it!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.360
A thrilling tale awaits. Be sure to catch it!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.360
Booking for “The Count Returns” opens today!

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:29.490
Welcome back, Klein.

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:34.750
Have you been busy lately?

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.830
There's breakfast in the kitchen 
if you want some.

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:39.310
Sure, after I finish work.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.310
The letters are on the way.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:52.110
I hope Mr. Azik and 
Madam Daly will reply soon.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.790
I don’t know what happened,

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:57.070
and what state the Captain is in.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.710
Only you two can give me answers.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.440
The reason for Dunn Smith's abnormality.

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.590
The reason for Dunn Smith's abnormality.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.200
No response.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.870
There’s not enough information, 
so the divination failed.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:30.590
Generally speaking,

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:33.990
divinations involving one's own safety
require the least amount of information.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:37.280
Perhaps I should try to divine my own safety.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:43.260
Dunn Smith's abnormality
will put me in danger.

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:47.190
Indeed.

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:51.470
The Captain's abnormality will put me
in danger and it’s no minor threat.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.910
Mr. Azik has replied!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:12.350
The scenario you described reminds me 
of Vampires and Mutants.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:19.110
Natural vampires were nearly extinct even before 
dragons and giants vanished from history.

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:20.670
But I remember,

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:24.790
there's a certain Sequence in one pathway
where a potion is named Vampire.

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:27.560
As for Mutants:

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:31.470
Rumor has it, they are ordinary humans 
who were corrupted or cursed,

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.870
and become monsters
under specific conditions.

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:39.220
Your superior might be 
a potential Mutant.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.000
Of course, these are just my guesses.

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:45.630
But regardless of which,

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:49.670
they prove your superior's current state 
is unstable and very dangerous.

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.710
You should be careful.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:57.150
Klein.

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:06.550
Captain?

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:08.950
Klein.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.510
Head to 62 Howes Street.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:16.520
Leonard found Lanevus's residence,
and is asking for your help.

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.340
Hey, you made it.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:22.970
Rough night?

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:26.750
How did you track it down?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.510
The lead you got from Hood Eugen.

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:31.990
You suspected Lanevus 
might be connected to Sirius.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:35.240
Sirius had dealings with many 
residents in the Howes Street area.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:36.870
So I checked them one by one.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:42.030
An elderly gentleman saw Lanevus’s photo and 
said the tenant at number 62 looked just like him.

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:43.900
But he hasn't been back in a long time.

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:47.150
I suspect there’s a hidden 
compartment in this house.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:55.550
There’s a hidden compartment
or secret chamber here.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.270
Another letter?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.650
"Hahaha!

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:17.550
Congratulations on finally 
finding this letter!

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.670
This means you're
not completely stupid.

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:26.470
You qualify to take part in this game
of life and death that I've designed."

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:30.300
<i>Madness always comes at a price.</i>

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:33.970
<i>The sin of blasphemy 
will never be forgiven.</i>

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.990
"Poverty. Disease.

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.790
Child laborers that die 
before their time.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:44.430
Factory workers who 
seldom live past thirty.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:49.350
Every factory in this city is shrouded 
in boundless resentment.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:53.280
Our game shall take place 
under such a setting.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:56.220
Fools.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.020
Prepare yourselves.

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:01.670
I've placed a bomb in the center of Tingen.

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:04.950
A bomb that grows stronger over time!"

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:06.890
A bomb?

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:09.350
"Go find it.

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:11.070
My dear friends."

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:12.670
Time is running out.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.630
We have to inform 
the Captain immediately.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:21.750
"If you lose the game...

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.870
Boom!

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:27.310
All of Tingen will 
be reduced to ashes.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.310
—The one who enjoys giving 
his friends pleasant surprises,

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.270
Lanevus."

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:45.430
I've never heard of a bomb 
that grows stronger over time.

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:51.270
It must be a bomb in the mystical sense.
Like an evil ritual that constantly accumulates power.

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.420
I agree with you.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:58.150
The resentment Lanevus described,

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.960
might be the energy source 
that strengthens the bomb.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.270
Blackthorn Security Company

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:03.870
The question is—

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:05.350
where exactly is the bomb?

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.630
What happened?

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.230
Where’s the Captain?

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:19.580
The bomb! Could it be on the altar 
I saw in Hood Eugen's Mind World?

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.400
But where is that altar?

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:23.790
Underground in Tingen's center?

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:42.750
Hello.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:44.860
Miss Megose?

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.630
Lanevus's fiancée?

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:51.580
She seemed to have some 
mental problems before,

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:54.430
claiming her child 
could whistle in the womb.

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:57.550
Miss Megose.

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:59.310
What brings you here?

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:04.480
I don't know. I just suddenly felt
like coming to Zouteland Street.

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:07.530
Somehow, I felt like paying 
a visit to take a look.

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:11.670
Her mental problems are getting worse.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.990
Last time, I didn’t get a chance 
to use Spirit Vision.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.240
Don’t look!

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:31.490
Don’t look!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:32.560
Don’t look!

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:41.010
You’ll die if you look!

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.110
The bomb Lanevus set isn’t on the altar—

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.200
It's the evil entity in Megose’s stomach!

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:06.750
"Idiot"

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:10.600
"I started the Industrial Revolution with my own hands 
and personally ushered in the Age of Steam and Machinery, 
only for it to create the conditions for the Evil God’s descent?!"

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.590
"I started the Industrial Revolution 
with my own hands,

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:14.430
and personally ushered in 
the Age of Steam and Machinery,

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:19.550
only for it to create the conditions 
for the Evil God’s descent?"

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.250
The copper whistle 
has been suppressed!

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:38.130
The Flaring Sun Charm isn't affected.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.450
Miss Megose.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:44.440
Do you have a request?

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:48.790
I’d like to speak about Lanevus.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:50.880
He told me...

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:52.990
you know a lot.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.190
He?

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.470
Who is he?

00:13:58.030 --> 00:13:58.890
My...

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.280
child.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:06.310
May I ask, would you
like a cup of coffee or tea?

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:09.660
A cup of warm water.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:11.480
Just a moment, Miss.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:14.200
Keep her calm.

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:36.000
Klein?

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:39.720
Mayor Dennis
Exposed for Corruption

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:51.630
I heard you and Mr. Lanevus 
first met at a banquet.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:54.270
Yes!

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.870
That was the first time I met him.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:14:59.500
At the city’s banquet.

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:02.910
He was dazzling.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.030
So charming and wealthy.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:09.310
A young tycoon everyone
had their eyes on that night.

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:14.710
Many beautiful ladies lined up for a
dance with him but for some reason...

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:17.080
He chose only me.

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:24.510
From waltz to quadrille, 
he stayed by my side all night.

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:27.990
Every word he said made me happy.

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:30.780
Every glance captivated me.

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:36.400
That’s when I knew—
I couldn’t imagine life without him.

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:45.390
Later, I was told he was a liar. 
That he had only deceived me.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.020
But that wasn’t true.

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:48.640
He treated me well.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:52.220
He often took me 
to gatherings with his friends.

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:55.300
He showed me many marvelous places.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:57.090
That day!

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.390
That day...

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.750
He gave me a necklace.

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.350
And said...

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.950
he had a surprise for me.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.680
The characteristics of Death's descendant.

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:25.390
Transform this mortal body…
into a vessel for "His" descent.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.850
Boundless resentment and gloom 
are like milk and honey.

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:33.310
They will become the sweet 
nourishment for the Holy Spirit.

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:47.030
You said she's not carrying Lanevus's child?

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:48.230
That's right.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:51.110
I tried to activate Spirit Vision
but my spirituality warned me:

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.430
You may not look directly at God.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:55.110
I remembered the altar 
in Eugen's Mind World,

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.510
and the divinity Lanevus promised him.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.870
I suspect what Megose carries is...

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:02.000
The Spawn of the True Creator.

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:06.640
Yes. That would explain why Mr. Havre, who
was tracking Megose, suddenly lost control.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.200
Maybe Old Neil was also influenced by "Him."

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:11.440
Moreover...

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:15.870
After we found Lanevus's letter, 
Megose suddenly appeared at our door.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.520
What an unusual coincidence.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:24.110
It was far too obvious, too direct—
no attempt to hide it at all!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:27.710
It seems the mastermind is finally 
taking matters into their own hands.

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:34.870
But after that incident, he disappeared.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:39.110
I searched for a long time, everywhere…
but couldn't find him.

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:43.350
Don't worry too much, Miss Megose.

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:44.670
Think about your child.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:45.670
My child!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:46.710
My child!

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:53.860
Her mental state can’t take much more.

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.470
Where are Frye and Royale?

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.550
They haven't returned yet.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.430
Notify all non-combat 
personnel to evacuate,

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.730
and have the police  
immediately clear all civilians.

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:06.190
Oh, regarding Mr. Lanevus's whereabouts:

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:08.510
We do have some new leads...

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:10.590
The captain has ordered an emergency.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:14.340
All clerical staff must evacuate.
It's too dangerous here. Go quickly!

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:26.310
The True Creator's Spawn is at minimum 
a Sequence 4 Mythical Creature.

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:28.470
We must immediately request aid 
from the Holy Cathedral,

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:31.270
the Mandated Punishers and 
the Church of Steam and Machinery.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.990
Sequence 4 Mythical Creature?

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:36.590
Can we stand a chance on our own?

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:38.070
Mr. Azik!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.670
If only he were still in Tingen…

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:44.830
The Copper Whistle has recovered its power!

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.870
I should notify Mr. Azik quickly.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.640
"Mr. Azik, the mastermind
who made my fate disharmonious,

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:57.430
and stole your son's skull
might soon appear.

00:18:57.430 --> 00:19:00.750
It involves the True Creator.
The situation is extremely urgent."

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:12.830
If the Holy Cathedral’s reinforcements 
don’t arrive in time, the evil god's Spawn will be born—

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:21.550
Take two Sealed Artifacts 
with strong offensive power.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:24.840
I'll apply to use 3-0782:
The Mutated Sun Sacred Emblem.

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:27.410
Someone from Backlund 
borrowed it yesterday.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.450
What a coincidence!

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:32.170
At present, Tingen has only three 
Grade 2 Sealed Artifacts.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:35.230
Two of them have unknown effects 
against High-Squence Beyonders.

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:39.240
2-105, the Blood Vessel Thief, 
has been proven effective against them.

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:42.710
It can steal an ability from 
a target within a certain range—

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.460
though the probability is low.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:45.900
Then let’s choose it.

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:51.460
Anyone who touches 2-105
will have their life energy stolen.

00:19:51.510 --> 00:19:55.190
Remember: at Sequence 8, 
its usage limit is 30 minutes.

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:58.600
I’ll inform Leonard of all 
the necessary precautions.

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:00.430
My dear Poet,

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:02.830
it’s time for you 
to reveal your secret.

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:06.700
Which one will you use?

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:09.270
I have other plans.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:14.230
Saint Selena.

00:20:15.030 --> 00:20:16.910
Saint Selena.

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:22.480
I request authorization 
to use the Core Seal:

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:24.240
Saint Selena's Ashes.

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.950
This—requires special authorization
from the Holy Cathedral.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:31.080
As Captain of the Tingen Nighthawks,

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:34.740
I have the authority to use 
Saint Selena’s Ashes in emergencies!

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:07.960
High-Sequence Beyonder Characteristic
Core Seal of Tingen's Chanis Gate

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:18.990
The Core Seal is gone.

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:21.350
Chanis Gate is in your hands.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:23.630
May the Goddess bless you.

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:52.750
The Holy Cathedral has responded:

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:54.950
Buy time. Reinforcements 
are on the way.

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:56.870
What about those coincidences?

00:21:56.950 --> 00:21:58.150
No reply.

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:01.040
Our priority is buying time.

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:04.060
Let’s hope the spawn inside 
Miss Megose can wait.

00:22:08.670 --> 00:22:11.110
He has another residence on Howes Street?

00:22:11.110 --> 00:22:13.190
He never mentioned it to me!

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:17.310
Don’t be foolish.

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:19.790
Just go. Escape now.

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:20.910
What are you—!

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:23.930
Hiding?

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:30.390
Mr. Lanevus actually 
encountered some difficulties,

00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:32.390
and had no choice 
but to leave Tingen.

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:35.380
Once it’s resolved, 
he’ll come back for you…

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:37.320
and your child.

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:39.780
Really?

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:42.710
It must be true!

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:46.150
He loves his child.

00:22:46.390 --> 00:22:47.670
For his child...

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:49.320
he would definitely return.

00:22:49.510 --> 00:22:51.330
Mr. Moretti said the same.

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:54.570
This child is the key to finding Lanevus.

00:22:54.790 --> 00:22:56.510
Klein Moretti?

00:22:57.110 --> 00:22:58.070
Yes!

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:00.310
The excellent diviner!

00:23:00.550 --> 00:23:04.030
I think someone told me…
that if I came here,

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:06.550
you would help me to deliver my child faster.

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:07.660
Who–

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:09.000
Who told you that?

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:11.350
There was a voice…

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:14.390
A voice that said:

00:23:14.390 --> 00:23:17.070
"Go to Zotland Street to meet a friend."

00:23:21.470 --> 00:23:24.020
The evil god's Spawn
is still barely stable.

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:26.630
I’ll head upstairs.
You stay here.

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:28.070
Captain.

00:23:28.150 --> 00:23:29.410
I almost forgot.

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:33.630
I’ve got Daly’s reply for you.

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:37.640
But she insisted I explain it myself.

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:48.110
In the mystical realm
there exists a law:

00:23:48.390 --> 00:23:51.750
Law of Beyonder 
Characteristics Indestructibility.

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:54.890
The characteristics are never 
destroyed, only passed on.

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:57.610
When Daly and I discovered this,

00:23:58.030 --> 00:24:01.050
the Holy Cathedral told us to keep it secret 
and gave us two choices.

00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:06.390
First choice: Submit all Beyonder 
Characteristics to the Holy Cathedral.

00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:07.890
The second:

00:24:08.790 --> 00:24:11.680
For Sequences of the same pathway, 
consume them yourself.

00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:14.850
I’m unsure of their true intentions.

00:24:15.270 --> 00:24:18.170
At the same time, this greatly 
affects potion digestion.

00:24:17.470 --> 00:24:19.720
Kenley White

00:24:20.550 --> 00:24:22.710
Still, I made that choice.

00:24:25.630 --> 00:24:27.950
To be with them forever.

00:24:38.990 --> 00:24:40.350
Captain.

00:24:50.990 --> 00:24:53.750
My child!

00:24:56.900 --> 00:24:58.390
Run, brat!

00:25:05.270 --> 00:25:07.350
Calm down, Miss Megose!

00:25:07.350 --> 00:25:09.000
Think about your child!

00:25:09.190 --> 00:25:12.470
His birth deserves both parents’ blessings!

00:25:12.990 --> 00:25:15.070
Lanevus will be back in a few days!

00:25:15.070 --> 00:25:16.590
Just wait a little longer!

00:25:16.750 --> 00:25:18.830
Just wait a little longer...

00:25:19.350 --> 00:25:23.790
Didn’t you say the father would 
return once the child was born?!

00:25:27.190 --> 00:25:28.710
The final act.

00:25:29.190 --> 00:25:31.110
Begins.

00:25:43.790 --> 00:25:44.580
Run!

00:25:44.750 --> 00:25:47.550
The evil god’s spawn cannot 
withstand Saint Selena’s Ashes.

00:25:47.550 --> 00:25:48.900
Birth is imminent!

00:25:50.150 --> 00:25:51.430
Saint Selena’s Ashes?

00:27:04.030 --> 00:27:09.210
Burn my broken shell to new sight

00:27:09.540 --> 00:27:17.310
To be free in mist to hold a cup of light

00:27:17.880 --> 00:27:21.250
Where are the flames that come in fury?

00:27:21.310 --> 00:27:24.520
Where are the keys that carve truth from me?

00:27:24.770 --> 00:27:30.350
Into the dark to dream and scream my name

00:27:30.370 --> 00:27:33.570
Wonder or dismay

00:27:33.600 --> 00:27:37.230
Madness or decay

00:27:37.450 --> 00:27:39.310
With fragile light

00:27:39.330 --> 00:27:43.400
I vow to guard a world I stay

00:27:43.940 --> 00:27:47.360
Stirring or delay

00:27:47.380 --> 00:27:50.690
Rebirth or be same

00:27:51.290 --> 00:27:56.560
With whispers in gray guide my shadow way

00:27:56.910 --> 00:28:00.470
Fade away